
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>SOL | The Art of Style</title>
<meta name="description" content="SOL — Beyond the Ordinary. Discover men's fashion, accessories and lifestyle.">

<style>
:root {
  --black: #101010;
  --white: #f6f5f2;
  --gold: #c5a66c;
  --muted: #999;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

body {
  background: var(--black);
  color: var(--white);
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

header {
  min-height: 78px;
  padding: 18px 7%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #292929;
}

.logo {
  font-size: 34px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 7px;
}

.logo-o {
  display: inline-block;
  color: var(--gold);
  background: linear-gradient(120deg,#8e6d37,#f5dfaa,#a77c38,#e7cc91);
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
}

nav {
  display: flex;
  gap: 25px;
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}

nav a:hover { color: var(--gold); }

.hero {
  min-height: 570px;
  padding: 100px 8%;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at center,#29251d 0%,#171717 42%,#101010 75%);
}

.hero .eyebrow {
  color: var(--gold);
  letter-spacing: 5px;
  font-size: 11px;
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(40px,8vw,88px);
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.1;
}

.hero p {
  color: #bcbcbc;
  letter-spacing: 5px;
  font-size: 12px;
  margin-top: 25px;
}

.gold-line {
  width: 55px;
  height: 2px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg,#8e6d37,#f5dfaa,#a77c38);
  margin: 30px auto;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  border: 1px solid var(--gold);
  color: var(--gold);
  padding: 14px 32px;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  transition: .3s;
}

.btn:hover {
  background: var(--gold);
  color: var(--black);
}

section { padding: 75px 7%; }

.section-title {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 45px;
}

.section-title h2 {
  font-size: 27px;
  letter-spacing: 4px;
}

.section-title p {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  margin-top: 12px;
}

.categories {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
  gap: 16px;
}

.category {
  min-height: 190px;
  border: 1px solid #303030;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg,#242424,#151515);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  transition: .3s;
  padding: 20px;
}

.category:hover {
  border-color: var(--gold);
  transform: translateY(-4px);
}

.category h3 {
  font-size: 17px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.category span {
  display: block;
  color: var(--gold);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  margin-top: 12px;
}

.statement {
  text-align: center;
  background: #171717;
  padding: 85px 8%;
}

.statement h2 {
  font-size: clamp(25px,5vw,42px);
  letter-spacing: 3px;
}

.statement p {
  color: #aaa;
  margin-top: 18px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

footer {
  padding: 35px 7%;
  text-align: center;
  border-top: 1px solid #292929;
}

footer .logo { margin-bottom: 15px; }

footer p {
  color: #888;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  line-height: 2;
}

@media(max-width:700px) {
  header { flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }
  nav { flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 15px; }
  .hero { min-height: 470px; }
  .categories { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
  section { padding: 55px 5%; }
}

@media(max-width:400px) {
  .categories { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <a href="#" class="logo">S<span class="logo-o">O</span>L</a>
  <nav>
    <a href="#home">HOME</a>
    <a href="#categories">CATEGORIES</a>
    <a href="#about">ABOUT</a>
    <a href="#contact">CONTACT</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="eyebrow">THE ART OF STYLE</div>
    <h1>BEYOND THE<br>ORDINARY.</h1>
    <div class="gold-line"></div>
    <p>DEFINED BY DETAILS.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="#categories">EXPLORE COLLECTION</a>
  </section>

  <section id="categories">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>OUR COLLECTIONS</h2>
      <p>STYLE THAT DEFINES YOU</p>
    </div>

    <div class="categories">
      <a class="category" href="#contact">
        <div><h3>CASUAL WEAR</h3><span>EVERYDAY ELEGANCE</span></div>
      </a>
      <a class="category" href="#contact">
        <div><h3>SPORTSWEAR</h3><span>MOVE WITH CONFIDENCE</span></div>
      </a>
      <a class="category" href="#contact">
        <div><h3>WATCHES</h3><span>TIMELESS DETAILS</span></div>
      </a>
      <a class="category" href="#contact">
        <div><h3>ACCESSORIES</h3><span>THE FINAL TOUCH</span></div>
      </a>
      <a class="category" href="#contact">
        <div><h3>FRAGRANCE & CARE</h3><span>YOUR SIGNATURE</span></div>
      </a>
      <a class="category" href="#contact">
        <div><h3>FOOTWEAR</h3><span>STEP INTO STYLE</span></div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="statement" id="about">
    <h2>DEFINED BY DETAILS.</h2>
    <div class="gold-line"></div>
    <p>
      Style is more than what you wear.<br>
      It is the confidence behind every detail.
    </p>
  </section>
</main>

<footer id="contact">
  <div class="logo">S<span class="logo-o">O</span>L</div>
  <p>THE ART OF STYLE</p>
  <p>BEYOND THE ORDINARY.</p>
  <p>© 2026 SOL. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
